VST v40,r17,r0,0,0,7,0
ADDI r17,r16,1600
VST v41,r17,r0,0,0,7,0
ADDI r17,r16,1664
VST v42,r17,r0,0,0,7,0
ADDI r17,r16,1728
VST v43,r17,r0,0,0,7,0
ADDI r17,r16,1792
VST v44,r17,r0,0,0,7,0
ADDI r17,r16,1856
